# CR 701.8, 115.1: Duress targets an opponent; Mode$ RevealYouChoose makes the
# caster, not the target, choose among the target's DiscardValid$
# Card.nonCreature+nonLand cards (DiscardEffect.java:226-264). The caster
# picks Lightning Bolt; the target discards it. Grizzly Bears and Mountain
# are never offered, and Counterspell stays because NumCards$ is 1.
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 2 B
queue targets ai
queue cardchoice 3
castspell human 1
resolvestack
